<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Paramètres - Administration</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('css/admin.css') }}">
</head>

<body>
<div class="sidebar">
    <div class="logo">
        <div class="logo-circle">
            <img src="{{ asset('images/logo.jpeg') }}" alt="Orange" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 50%;">
        </div>
        <div>
            <div class="logo-text">NetWON</div>
            <div class="logo-sub">You Don't Save Time. You WON It</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <span class="nav-section">Administration</span>
    <a href="{{ path('admin_dashboard') }}" class="nav-item">🏠 Dashboard</a>
    <a href="{{ path('admin_users') }}" class="nav-item">👥 Gestion Utilisateurs</a>
    <a href="#" class="nav-item">📊 Rapports</a>

    <span class="nav-section">Système</span>
    <a href="{{ path('admin_settings') }}" class="nav-item active">⚙️ Paramètres</a>
    <a href="{{ path('app_logout') }}" class="logout-btn">🚪 Déconnexion</a>
</div>

<div class="main">
    <div class="topbar">
        <h1>Paramètres du système</h1>
        <div class="user-badge">
            <div class="avatar">A</div>
            {{ user.fullName }}
        </div>
    </div>

    {% for msg in app.flashes('success') %}
        <div class="flash-success">✅ {{ msg }}</div>
    {% endfor %}

    {% for msg in app.flashes('error') %}
        <div class="flash-error">❌ {{ msg }}</div>
    {% endfor %}

    <div class="settings-container">
        <div class="settings-card">
            <h2>Configuration générale</h2>
            
            {{ form_start(form) }}
            
            <div class="form-group">
                {{ form_label(form.site_name) }}
                {{ form_widget(form.site_name) }}
                {{ form_errors(form.site_name) }}
                <small class="form-text">Le nom qui apparaîtra dans l'interface</small>
            </div>
            
            <div class="form-group">
                {{ form_label(form.items_per_page) }}
                {{ form_widget(form.items_per_page) }}
                {{ form_errors(form.items_per_page) }}
                <small class="form-text">Nombre d'éléments affichés par page dans les listes</small>
            </div>
            
            <div class="form-group checkbox-group">
                {{ form_widget(form.maintenance_mode) }}
                {{ form_label(form.maintenance_mode) }}
                {{ form_errors(form.maintenance_mode) }}
                <small class="form-text">Activez pour mettre le site en maintenance (seuls les admins peuvent accéder)</small>
            </div>
            
            <div class="form-actions">
                <button type="submit" class="btn-save">💾 Sauvegarder</button>
                <a href="{{ path('admin_dashboard') }}" class="btn-cancel">Annuler</a>
            </div>
            
            {{ form_end(form) }}
        </div>
        
        <div class="info-card">
            <h3>ℹ️ Information</h3>
            <p>Les paramètres sont sauvegardés temporairement.</p>
            <p><strong>Pour une persistance permanente :</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Utilisez un fichier <code>config/parameters.yaml</code></li>
                <li>Ou créez une entité <code>Setting</code> en base de données</li>
            </ul>
            <hr>
            <h4>Paramètres actuels :</h4>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Nom du site :</strong> {{ form.site_name.vars.value }}</li>
                <li><strong>Éléments/page :</strong> {{ form.items_per_page.vars.value }}</li>
                <li><strong>Mode maintenance :</strong> {{ form.maintenance_mode.vars.value ? 'Activé' : 'Désactivé' }}</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
.settings-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 350px;
    gap: 25px;
    margin-top: 20px;
}

.settings-card, .info-card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 25px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}

.settings-card h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
    color: #ff6600;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
}

.form-group {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.form-group label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #333;
}

.form-control {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 10px;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 14px;
    transition: border-color 0.3s;
}

.form-control:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: #ff6600;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(255,102,0,0.1);
}

.form-text {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 5px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #6c757d;
}

.checkbox-group {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.checkbox-input {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    cursor: pointer;
}

.checkbox-group label {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
}

.checkbox-group .form-text {
    width: 100%;
    margin-left: 30px;
}

.form-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 15px;
    margin-top: 30px;
}

.btn-save {
    background: #ff6600;
    color: white;
    border: none;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: background 0.3s;
}

.btn-save:hover {
    background: #e65500;
}

.btn-cancel {
    background: #6c757d;
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: background 0.3s;
    display: inline-block;
}

.btn-cancel:hover {
    background: #5a6268;
    color: white;
}

.info-card {
    background: #f8f9fa;
    border-left: 4px solid #ff6600;
}

.info-card h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    color: #ff6600;
}

.info-card h4 {
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    color: #333;
}

.info-card code {
    background: #e9ecef;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 12px;
}

.info-card ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin: 10px 0;
}

.info-card hr {
    margin: 15px 0;
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid #dee2e6;
}

.flash-error {
    background: #f8d7da;
    color: #721c24;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    border-left: 4px solid #f5c6cb;
}
</style>

</body>
</html>